Package: fastsas
Title: Fast SAS7BDAT Reader Backed by Rust
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R:
    person("Tobias", "Kragholm", , "tkragholm@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: High-performance reader for SAS7BDAT files. The parsing core is
    implemented in Rust (the sas7bdat crate) and exposed to R via extendr.
    Returns a tibble with haven-compatible column types (Date, POSIXct, hms,
    character, double).
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Language: en-US
